{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112863445825785857"]}, "author_id": "2109772490470006784", "created_at": "2026-10-21T11:08:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112863522304729107"], "id": "2112863522304729107", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta's Muse Wonder models are here — built for real-world agentic tasks: insurance claims, leases, finances, coding. Active Memory + Active Focus. Available via Meta Model API and Muse Code. #Meta #Muse https://t.co/5ByxajDXtw", "url": "https://x.com/AzAutomatixdt/status/2112863522304729107"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112822592667287552"]}, "author_id": "2096203879126085632", "created_at": "2026-10-21T08:26:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112822784560927069"], "id": "2112822784560927069", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "𝑫𝒆𝒆𝒑𝑺𝒆𝒆𝒌 𝑱𝒖𝒔𝒕 𝑴𝒂𝒅𝒆 𝑰𝒕 𝑬𝒂𝒔𝒚 𝒕𝒐 𝑩𝒖𝒊𝒍𝒅 𝒐𝒏 𝑪𝒉𝒆𝒂𝒑 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔\n\nDeepSeek shipped V4.1-Flash-1017 today\n\nOpen weights MIT license\n\nEvery benchmark up outputs shorter prices unchanged\n\n𝐓𝐡𝐞 𝐩𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐧𝐨𝐛𝐨𝐝𝐲'𝐬 𝐭𝐚𝐥𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐚𝐛𝐨𝐮𝐭: https://t.co/ItahwAu0oQ", "url": "https://x.com/not_4n_ai/status/2112822784560927069"}, {"author_id": "2092902544020291584", "created_at": "2026-10-21T07:36:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112810208145596556"], "id": "2112810208145596556", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 175, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Wednesday morning AI FACTS roundup 🤖 21.10\n\n- 🔍 Google ($GOOGL) unveils EmbeddingGemma 2: a 740M-parameter embedding model that runs locally on devices\n- 🧠 Meta released Muse Spark Open: an open-weights model with 816B parameters\n- 🦂 Anthropic’s Claude autonomously designed", "url": "https://x.com/AIDailyNews_2x/status/2112810208145596556"}, {"author_id"